  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1  Integrated Financing Strategies for Accelerating SDG Progress Implemented
1.2. SDS, Sector Plans Costed and Gender Responsive Financing Frameworks
1.3. Evidence-Based Financing Mechanisms available to Mobilize Public and Private &#x2013; resources to Respond to Samoa&#x2019;s National Development Plan (NDP)</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2020">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 DFAs for Cook Islands and Niue will be completed, to map development finance flows and identify financing challenges to be addressed within country context, Samoa&#x2019;s 2018 DFA report will be updated to reflect any changes in financing flows and the country&#x2019;s public financial management system
1.2 Develop Samoa&#x2019;s INFF to integrate the SDGs into the PFM system through budget reforms; cost the SDS and sector plans; and ensure that they are gender responsive.
1.3  Focuses on increasing private sector contributions to financing Samoa&#x2019;s national development agenda. Developing the private sector&#x2019;s SDG investment capacity requires strategic partnerships for co-financing with the public sector.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1.1. Develop Terms of Reference and mobilize TA for the DFA Review for Samoa 
1.1.2. Develop Terms of Reference for the INFF Oversight Committee 
1.1.3. Establish INFF Oversight committee with at least one convened meeting</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1.1. Successfully completed the LPAC Process and mobilization of Year 1 Tranche of Funds 
1.1.2. Terms of Reference for International TA for DFA Review developed and was advertised in Dec 2020
1.1.3. Terms of Reference for Samoa INFF Oversight Committee developed and circulated to Ministry of Finance as technical lead agency of the Government, pending confirmation and approval of establishing new committee or utilize existing mechanisms in place.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Complete the review of Samoas development financing assessment report (DFA)
2. Complete the DRA inception worj=kshop for Cook Islands and Niue
3. Compete the development of Cook Islands development financing assessment report (DFA)
4. Complete the review/Gaps analysis and develop private sector developing strategy for Samoa</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Samoa DFA Review partially completed, remaining works deferred to 2022
2.	DFA Inception Workshop Cook Islands COMPLETED 
3.	DFA Development Cook Islands partially completed, remaining works deferred to 2022 
4.	Gaps Analysis &amp; Strategy Development for Private Sector deferred to 2022</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
